close_reason: Typed update-many dispatch clears or refuses a null like a single update
contract_change:
  api: runAction update-many (flat and nested update fields); PmUpdateManyActionOptions
  before: A null on an update field was dropped silently while the rest of the update applied; the option type refused null
  after: "For typed SDK dispatch a null on a clearable field clears it on every matched row, any other null refuses by name before a row changes, and a null on ids, limit, offset or a filter key refuses with invalid_argument_value. PmUpdateManyActionOptions types clearable fields as nullable. MCP update-many still treats null as an omitted argument"
  migrate: "Remove a null you relied on being ignored, or keep it to clear the field. Omit a selection key instead of passing null"
escape_class: review_caught_late
gate_evidence:
