  owner: pm-w7clh6
  gate_id: update-many-typed-null-transport
  negative_control: "tests/unit/sdk/runtime/update-many-null-transport.spec.ts runs one request through the flat, nested and nested-with-list runAction spellings and requires a cleared assignee and sprint beside an applied description; on main all three keep the assignee. It also requires the single-update refusal text for a null title and a null alias, a named refusal for a null on ids, limit, offset and a filter key, and an unchanged assignee for an MCP-marked dispatch"
